sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Camera
    participant A as ai-engine
    participant R as Redis Streams
    participant B as backend (consumer)
    participant P as Postgres
    participant W as WebSocket clients
    C->>A: frame N
    A->>A: detect + track
    A->>A: zones + queue + anomaly
    A->>R: XADD store.events {event}
    R-->>B: XREADGROUP delivers {event}
    B->>P: INSERT events / zone_metrics / ...
    B->>W: broadcast JSON
    B->>R: XACK
